# Normalize text files to LF in the repository; checkouts follow core.autocrlf.
# Without this, 25/48 tracked files mixed CRLF and LF and every cross-machine
# checkout produced phantom diffs (review 2026-10-06, 06-R10).
* text=auto

# Binaries — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.exe binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
*.ico binary
